P175,9,63487d50d1d4592517c32490,Lambda functions are useful for writing small  one-time use functions without the need to define a separate function. They allow for writing functional-style code in Python  which can make the code more concise and easier to read. Lambda functions can be used in combination with built-in functions such as map  filter  and reduce  which can make it easier to write functional-style code. They are also commonly used when passing a function as an argument to another function  such as in the case of sort or sorted. Overall  the use of lambda functions can improve code readability and make it easier to write functional-style code in Python.,Readability/Understandability
P175,9,63487d50d1d4592517c32490,Lambda functions are useful for writing small  one-time use functions without the need to define a separate function. They allow for writing functional-style code in Python  which can make the code more concise and easier to read. Lambda functions can be used in combination with built-in functions such as map  filter  and reduce  which can make it easier to write functional-style code. They are also commonly used when passing a function as an argument to another function  such as in the case of sort or sorted. Overall  the use of lambda functions can improve code readability and make it easier to write functional-style code in Python.,Ease of use
P175,9,63487d50d1d4592517c32490,Lambda functions are useful for writing small  one-time use functions without the need to define a separate function. They allow for writing functional-style code in Python  which can make the code more concise and easier to read. Lambda functions can be used in combination with built-in functions such as map  filter  and reduce  which can make it easier to write functional-style code. They are also commonly used when passing a function as an argument to another function  such as in the case of sort or sorted. Overall  the use of lambda functions can improve code readability and make it easier to write functional-style code in Python., Coding time
P204,9,64018874cca3f5902f36f686,Lambda functions are often used to create small  anonymous functions on the fly that can be passed as arguments to other functions or used in list comprehensions. They can be used to make code more concise and easier to read  as well as to avoid the need for defining separate functions. They are particularly useful when dealing with data that needs to be processed quickly and efficiently.,Performance
