P202,10,63f9f9b6a226ebe3206f6de8,lambda functions are often used by developers in functional programming to create small anonymous functions that can be used as arguments to higher-order functions  such as map()  filter()  and reduce(). Lambda functions can be more concise and readable than defining a named function for a simple operation that is only used once  especially when the function is small and the argument list is short. Lambda functions can also be used to write more declarative and expressive code  which can make it easier to reason about and debug.,Readability/Understandability
P202,10,63f9f9b6a226ebe3206f6de8,lambda functions are often used by developers in functional programming to create small anonymous functions that can be used as arguments to higher-order functions  such as map()  filter()  and reduce(). Lambda functions can be more concise and readable than defining a named function for a simple operation that is only used once  especially when the function is small and the argument list is short. Lambda functions can also be used to write more declarative and expressive code  which can make it easier to reason about and debug.,Size
P207,10,64054cab1cde940e216d9eb3,I only tend to use lambdas when I would otherwise have to define a new function for proper decomposition but that seems unnecessary (i.e. the operation is simple).,
P209,10,6405ebd9ab50bd5a571e2a5a,Using lambda functions can help keep code organized and reduce the number of named functions that need to be defined in a module.,
